  "_readme": "Brand and global settings. features.businesses switches the whole business directory on or off (nav link, footer column, /businesses pages, business mentions in content and search). It is off for now. cards.showProvider / cards.showStats show or hide the creator name and the views, likes and comments on every content card (both hidden for now). features.saved.limit caps the 'Saved' list (kept in the visitor's browser localStorage, which is small); set features.saved to false to remove it.",
